The package has one visual grammar and the role names state it:
\itemize{
\item \strong{\verb{reporting*}} -- the \emph{reporting} process: report dates, delays, anything
about \strong{when we found out}. Red by default.
\item \strong{\verb{epidemic*}} -- the \emph{epidemic} process: event dates, case counts,
